      "ACTION-REPAIR-2 independently thinks as the same programmer as ACTION-REPAIR, reconstructs root-cause hypotheses, candidate patch logic, regression risk and counterfactual checks",
      "ACTION-REPAIR independently performs the same programmer reasoning and compares against the twin",
      "ACTION-REPAIR synthesizes the bounded repair from the independent programmer analyses before mutation",
      "ACTION-REPAIR-2 must challenge the primary with independent evidence; its conclusion is not mutation authority",
      "ACTION-REPAIR applies the minimal source repair only as active owner",
      "ACTION-HISTORIAN-3 records every attempt and every failure",
      "Canonical GREEN closes the mission and promotes only verified learning"
